<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Knights profit slips, gold output steady.</title>
<headline>Knights profit slips, gold output steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  3.66 vs 4.86</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  0.27 vs 0.43</p>
<p>    Tonnes treated			 934,000 vs 928,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			   324 vs 322</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    0.35 vs 0.34</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     52,011 vs 52,069</p>
<p>Full name: Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
